  <!-- EN: chemfuel puddle -->
  <ChemfuelPuddle.label>化学燃料水坑</ChemfuelPuddle.label>
  <!-- EN: A puddle of sticky, flammable chemfuel. -->
  <ChemfuelPuddle.description>一滩粘稠易燃的化学燃料。</ChemfuelPuddle.description>
  <!-- EN: chemfuel trap -->
  <ChemfuelTripwire.label>化学燃料陷阱</ChemfuelTripwire.label>
  <!-- EN: A tripwire hooked up to an igniting device and installed over a puddle of flammable chemfuel. When triggered, it ignites a roaring fire in a concentrated area. Can be built next to each other. -->
  <ChemfuelTripwire.description>绊线与点火装置相连，安装在一滩易燃化学燃料上。一旦触发，它就会在集中区域点燃熊熊大火。可相邻建造。</ChemfuelTripwire.description>
  <!-- EN: electric arc -->
  <Electric_Arc.label>电弧</Electric_Arc.label>
  <!-- EN: glue trap -->
  <GlueTrap.label>胶水陷阱</GlueTrap.label>
  <!-- EN: A puddle of smeared insect jelly. The substance is extremely sticky, making passage difficult. While it is waterproof and will remain sticky for a long time, the substance is also flammable. -->
  <GlueTrap.description>一滩沾满污渍的昆虫果冻。这种物质粘性极强，很难通过。虽然这种物质防水并能长时间保持粘性，但它也是易燃物。</GlueTrap.description>
  <!-- EN: grenade bouquet -->
  <GrenadeBouquet.label>手榴弹花束</GrenadeBouquet.label>
  <!-- EN: A tripwire hooked up to a bundle of frag grenades and a flashbang. When triggered, the grenades will depin and scatter on the ground as the flashbang detonates and stuns those nearby. Highly effective and equally destructive. -->
  <GrenadeBouquet.description>一根绊线连接着一捆碎片手榴弹和一个闪光弹。触发后，手榴弹会在地面上炸开并散落一地，而闪光弹则会引爆并眩晕附近的人。效果显著，破坏力同样巨大。</GrenadeBouquet.description>
  <!-- EN: live grenade -->
  <Live_Grenade.label>实弹手榴弹</Live_Grenade.label>
  <!-- EN: tesla coil -->
  <Tesla_Coil.label>特斯拉线圈</Tesla_Coil.label>
  <!-- EN: A tesla coil made to be mounted on a turret. -->
  <Tesla_Coil.description>安装在炮塔上的特斯拉线圈。</Tesla_Coil.description>
  <Tesla_Coil.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>特斯拉线圈</Tesla_Coil.verbs.Verb_Shoot.label>
  <!-- EN: tesla stunner -->
